    pose proof ot_itinerary_s as (_ & _ & _ & _ & _ & SCALL).
    tblk rH3s factsH3s scr0 (sc_ret scG3s) srH3s0 knH3s0 323%nat (ENV vals) M R msF mo HR HK ltac:(constructor) OK RS.
